 "widget_blurbs": {
  "A note or heading — markdown-lite text you write yourself.": "自定义笔记或标题，支持轻量 Markdown 文本。",
  "Recently edited docs, how many you have, and a one-line note creator.": "展示最近编辑的文档、文档总数，以及一行快速记笔记入口。",
  "The latest items from a chosen feed, as a scrollable list or grid.": "以可滚动列表或网格形式展示所选订阅源的最新资讯。",
  "Unread mail, the account sync status and who writes to you most.": "查看未读邮件、账户同步状态及最常联系你的发件人。",
  "Running timers, hours and value tracked, budgets, deadlines and the entry feed.": "汇总运行中的计时器、已记录时长与价值、预算、截止日期及记录流。",
  "Pick a category + template and open the add-trade form.": "选择分类和模板，快速打开新增交易表单。",
  "Your trading numbers: PnL, win rate, equity curve, exposure, behaviour.": "核心交易指标：盈亏、胜率、权益曲线、风险敞口与交易行为。",
  "A short scrollable list of goals with progress; add one inline.": "可滚动的目标进度简表，支持行内直接新增目标。",
  "A quick add-reminder form.": "快速添加提醒表单。",
  "Unread notifications, what is due next, and the reminders that stalled.": "查看未读通知、即将到期事项以及滞后的提醒。",
  "Upcoming events, counts, categories, a mini month and what is due across modules.": "展示近期日程、数量与分类、迷你月历及跨模块待到期事项。",
  "TradingView economic calendar, compressed and scrollable.": "紧凑可滚动的 TradingView 财经日历。",
  "Value, PnL, allocation, positions and movers for one portfolio.": "单个投资组合的市值、盈亏、资产配置、持仓与涨跌异动。",
  "Recurring spend, forecast, spend by category and what renews next.": "周期性支出、支出预测、分类统计及即将续费项目。",
  "Net worth, its change over the window, and a trend line.": "净资产总额、统计窗口内变动及趋势曲线。",
  "Your prompts by tag, the latest changes, and the most-iterated ones.": "按标签整理的提示词、最新修改记录与迭代最多的版本。",
  "Ask the agent — pick model and tools, send, land in the conversation.": "向 Agent 提问：选择模型与工具后发送，直接进入对话。",
  "Recent conversations and how many tokens they have spent.": "最近对话记录及其 Token 消耗情况。",
  "Quotes, movers, best/worst, a sparkline, sync status and alerts near trigger.": "行情报价、涨跌异动、领涨与领跌、走势微图、同步状态及临近触发的预警。",
  "One hive as a honeycomb, as small line charts, or as a table with the columns you pick.": "将单个蜂群展示为蜂巢热图、迷你折线图或自定义列数据表。",
  "Macro trends, company metrics and statements, filings, upcoming earnings and valuation comparisons.": "宏观趋势、公司财务指标与报表、公告文件、即将发布的财报及估值对比。",
  "What is running, what runs next, and which workflows keep failing.": "查看正在运行、即将调度以及持续失败的工作流。",
  "How much arrives, which endpoints error, and which have gone silent.": "查看接收总量、报错端点以及长时间无响应的静默端点。",
  "Datasets stored, disk used, the job queue and what needs a refill.": "已存储数据集、磁盘占用、任务队列及待补采数据。",
  "Your best saved run, the win-rate leaderboard and the strategy library.": "最佳保存回测、胜率排行榜与策略库。",
  "Your favourites by type and folder, catalog freshness, and what went stale.": "按类型与文件夹分类的收藏、目录新鲜度及已过期条目。",
  "Saved workspaces and lists, active price alerts, and what fired recently.": "已保存的工作区与列表、生效中的价格预警及近期触发记录。",
  "Tracked managers, the biggest books, and what one manager moved.": "关注的基金经理、最大持仓组合及单个经理的调仓动向。",
  "Saved community references, their categories, recent additions and quick access.": "已收藏的社区参考资料、分类汇总、近期新增及快速访问入口。",
  "Available data, risk and drawdown, correlations, seasonality, realized volatility and market regimes.": "可用数据、风险与回撤、相关性、季节性、已实现波动率及市场状态。",
  "Estimated tax for the year, the effective-rate trend, and a year-over-year table.": "年度预估税额、实际税率趋势及同比对照表。",
  "Bookmarks, counts per category, entries needing work, and top domains.": "书签列表、各分类数量、待完善条目及高频域名。",
  "Open positions with leverage, unrealized PnL, liquidation price and funding.": "当前持仓：杠杆、未实现盈亏、强平价、资金费"
